WEBVTT

00:17:29.396 --> 00:17:31.796
Bits, special area.

00:17:32.676 --> 00:17:37.716
Violent: axe wound, penis flytrap,
gash or a growler.

00:17:39.076 --> 00:17:41.716
The taxi driver on my way in told me

00:17:41.716 --> 00:17:45.476
that Glaswegian slang for cunnilingus
is "growling at the badger," which --

00:17:45.476 --> 00:17:46.796
(Laughter)

00:17:46.796 --> 00:17:48.636
I'll leave that with you.

00:17:48.956 --> 00:17:51.356
Or they just tend to be unpleasant,

00:17:51.356 --> 00:17:54.956
horrible images of fish and meat
and general putrescence,

00:17:54.996 --> 00:17:56.956
fish taco, bacon sandwich,

00:17:56.956 --> 00:18:01.356
badly stuffed kebab, bearded clam, etc.